    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d483">

                <pb facs="1052" n="956" xml:id="pg956"/>

                <head>No. 451.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Mendez de
                            Vigo to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain at Washington</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-03-29"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 29,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of His Catholic
                    Majesty, has the honor herewith to transmit to the honorable Secretary of State
                    of the United States, indorsed to his order, a draft for the sum of $10,000, in
                    payment of the indemnity granted by the Government of Spain to the owners of the
                    American barks Ellen Rizpah and Rising Sun, the promise made by this legation in
                    its note of the 15th of February last to the honorable Secretary of State being
                    hereby fulfilled.</p>
                <p>The undersigned avails himself, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer><signed>FELIPE MENDEZ DE VIGO.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d483-a1.xml" xpointer="d483-a1"/>
            </div>
